"k": "sumfra/ttei"}, {"t": "ὥστε", "o": 40, "k": "w(/ste"}, {"t": "μὴ", "o": 45, "k": "mh/"}, {"t": "εἶναι", "o": 48, "k": "ei)=nai"}]}, {"n": 32, "text": "τῷ πνεύματι ἔξοδον.", "tokens": [{"t": "τῷ", "o": 0, "k": "tw=|"}, {"t": "πνεύματι", "o": 3, "k": "pneu/mati"}, {"t": "ἔξοδον", "o": 12, "k": "e)/codon"}]}, {"n": 33, "text": "Διὰ τί, ὅσοι τὴν διὰ χειρὸς τομὴν ἔχουσι δι' ὅλης, μακροβιώτατοι;", "joined": true, "tokens": [{"t": "Διὰ", "o": 0, "k": "dia/"}, {"t": "τί", "o": 4, "k": "ti/"}, {"t": "ὅσοι", "o": 8, "k": "o(/soi"}, {"t": "τὴν", "o": 13, "k": "th/n"}, {"t": "διὰ", "o": 17, "k": "dia/"}, {"t": "χειρὸς", "o": 21, "k": "xeiro/s"}, {"t": "τομὴν", "o": 28, "k": "tomh/n"}, {"t": "ἔχουσι", "o": 34, "k": "e)/xousi"}, {"t": "δι'", "o": 41, "k": "di'"}, {"t": "ὅλης", "o": 45, "k": "o(/lhs"}, {"t": "μακροβιώτατοι", "o": 51, "k": "makrobiw/tatoi"}]}, {"n": 34, "text": "ἢ διότι τὰ ἄναρθρα βραχύβια καὶ ἀσθενῆ;", "tokens": [{"t": "ἢ", "o": 0, "k": "h)/"}, {"t": "διότι", "o": 2, "k": "dio/ti"}, {"t": "τὰ", "o": 8, "k": "ta/"}, {"t": "ἄναρθρα", "o": 11, "k": "a)/narqra"}, {"t": "βραχύβια", "o": 19, "k": "braxu/bia"}, {"t": "καὶ", "o": 28, "k": "kai/"}, {"t": "ἀσθενῆ", "o": 32, "k": "a)sqenh="}]}, {"n": 35, "text": "σημεῖον δὲ τῆς μὲν ἀσθενείας τὰ νέα, τῆς δὲ βραχυβιότητος", "tokens": [{"t": "σημεῖον", "o": 0, "k": "shmei=on"}, {"t": "δὲ", "o": 8, "k": "de/"}, {"t": "τῆς", "o": 11, "k": "th=s"}, {"t": "μὲν", "o": 15, "k": "me/n"}, {"t": "ἀσθενείας", "o": 19, "k": "a)sqenei/as"}, {"t": "τὰ", "o": 29, "k": "ta/"}, {"t": "νέα", "o": 32, "k": "ne/a"}, {"t": "τῆς", "o": 37, "k": "th=s"}, {"t": "δὲ", "o": 41, "k": "de/"}, {"t": "βραχυβιότητος", "o": 44, "k": "braxubio/thtos"}]}, {"n": 36, "text": "τὰ ἔνυγρα. δῆλον ἄρα ὅτι τὰ ἠρθρωμένα τοὐναντίον. τοιαῦτα", "tokens": [{"t": "τὰ", "o": 0, "k": "ta/"}, {"t": "ἔνυγρα", "o": 3, "k": "e)/nugra"}, {"t": "δῆλον", "o": 11, "k": "dh=lon"}, {"t": "ἄρα", "o": 17, "k": "a)/ra"}, {"t": "ὅτι", "o": 21, "k": "o(/ti"}, {"t": "τὰ", "o": 25, "k": "ta/"}, {"t": "ἠρθρωμένα", "o": 28, "k": "h)rqrwme/na"}, {"t": "τοὐναντίον", "o": 38, "k": "tou)nanti/on"}, {"t": "τοιαῦτα", "o": 50, "k": "toiau=ta"}]}, {"n": 37, "text": "δέ, ὧν καὶ τὰ φύσει ἄναρθρα μάλιστα ἤρθρωται. τῆς δὲ", "tokens": [{"t": "δέ", "o": 0, "k": "de/"}, {"t": "ὧν", "o": 4, "k": "w(=n"}, {"t": "καὶ", "o": 7, "k": "kai/"}, {"t": "τὰ", "o": 11, "k": "ta/"}, {"t": "φύσει", "o": 14, "k": "fu/sei"}, {"t": "ἄναρθρα", "o": 20, "k": "a)/narqra"}, {"t": "μάλιστα", "o": 28, "k": "ma/lista"}, {"t": "ἤρθρωται", "o": 36, "k": "h)/rqrwtai"}, {"t": "τῆς", "o": 46, "k": "th=s"}, {"t": "δὲ", "o": 50, "k": "de/"}]}, {"n": 38, "text": "χειρὸς τὸ ἔσω ἀναρθρότατον.", "tokens": [{"t": "χειρὸς", "o": 0, "k": "xeiro/s"}, {"t": "τὸ", "o": 7, "k": "to/"}, {"t": "ἔσω", "o": 10, "k": "e)/sw"}, {"t": "ἀναρθρότατον", "o": 14, "k": "a)narqro/taton"}]}, {"n": 39, "text": "Διὰ τί ἐν τῷ μακρὸν ἀναπνεῖν ἑλκόντων μὲν εἴσω τὸ", "tokens": [{"t": "Διὰ", "o": 0, "k": "dia/"}, {"t": "τί", "o": 4, "k": "ti/"}, {"t": "ἐν", "o": 7, "k": "e)n"}, {"t": "τῷ", "o": 10, "k": "tw=|"}, {"t": "μακρὸν", "o": 13, "k": "makro/n"}, {"t": "ἀναπνεῖν", "o": 20, "k": "a)napnei=n"}, {"t": "ἑλκόντων", "o": 29, "k": "e(lko/ntwn"}, {"t": "μὲν", "o": 38, "k": "me/n"}, {"t": "εἴσω", "o": 42, "k": "ei)/sw"}, {"t": "τὸ", "o": 47, "k": "to/"}]}], "english": {"text": "Why is it that the tongue becomes bitter and salty and acid, but never sweet? Is it because these qualities are corruptions and so the tongue cannot perceive its own real nature? Why is it that the coloration of the tongue corresponds with that of the skin? Is it because it is really an external part of the body, though it is enclosed in the mouth, and is it because the skin on it is thin that even a slight variegation of colour makes itself visible? Or is it because it is liquid that causes change of colour, and the tongue is most affected by what is drunk? Why is it that one can emit both hot and cold breath from the mouth? For one can puff out cold breath and breathe out warm breath. That the breath is warm can be demonstrated by placing the hand near the mouth. Or is the air which is set in motion warm in both cases, but does he who puffs out breath not set the air in motion all at once but blow through a partly closed mouth, so that, though he emits but little breath, he sets up motion over a large area of the outer air, in which the warmth from his mouth is not apparent owing to its scantiness? But one who breathes out breath emits it all at once, and therefore it is warm. For it is characteristic of puffing out breath to pack the air into a particularly small space; whereas breathing out air is emitting it all at once. Why is it that, if one expires violently and with all the breath at once, it is impossible to expire again? So too with violent inspiration, which cannot be repeated again immediately. Is it because expiration is a local dilatation, and inspiration a local contraction, both of which can be carried out within certain limits? Clearly, therefore, the two processes must be carried out one after another, but neither can be performed twice consecutively. Why is it that, though there is one passage through which meat and drink pass and another through which we breathe, if we swallow too large a morsel we choke? In this there is nothing strange; for not only do we choke if something penetrates into this passage, but we choke still more if it be blocked. Now the passages through which we take food and through which we breathe are parallel to one another; when, therefore, too large a morsel is swallowed, the respiration is also blocked, so that there is no way out for the breath. Why is it that men are very long-lived who have a cut right across the hand? Is it because those animals which are badly articulated are short-lived and weak? As an instance of weakness we may take young animals, and of shortness of life the aquatic creatures. Clearly then those who are well articulated must be the opposite, namely, those in whom even those parts are best articulated which are by nature badly articulated. Now the inside of the hand is the least well articulated part of the body. Why is it that, in deep breathing, when we draw in the", "notes": [], "markers": [{"kind": "section", "n": "5", "offset": 0}, {"kind": "section", "n": "6", "offset": 179}, {"kind": "section", "n": "7", "offset": 565}, {"kind": "section", "n": "8", "offset": 1348}, {"kind": "section", "n": "9", "offset": 1801}, {"kind": "section", "n": "10", "offset": 2333}, {"kind": "section", "n": "11", "offset": 2834}], "bekker": [{"n": 1, "offset": 0, "real": true}, {"n": 5, "offset": 235, "real": true}, {"n": 10, "offset": 565, "real": true}, {"n": 15, "offset": 953, "real": true}, {"n": 20, "offset": 1342, "real": false}, {"n": 25, "offset": 1736, "real": false}, {"n": 30, "offset": 2129, "real": true}, {"n": 35, "offset": 2498, "real": true}]}}, {"id": "34:964b", "column": "964b", "chapterStarts": [{"chapter": "12", "beforeLine": 5, "wordIndex": 0, "engOffset": 241, "bekker": "964b5–19"}], "greek": [{"n": 1, "text": "πνεῦμα συμπίπτει ἡ κοιλία, ἐκπνεόντων δὲ πληροῦται; πιθανὸν", "joined": true, "tokens": [{"t": "πνεῦμα", "o": 0, "k": "pneu=ma"}, {"t": "συμπίπτει", "o": 7, "k": "sumpi/ptei"}, {"t": "ἡ", "o": 17, "k": "h("}, {"t": "κοιλία", "o": 19, "k": "koili/a"}, {"t": "ἐκπνεόντων", "o": 27, "k": "e)kpneo/ntwn"}, {"t": "δὲ", "o": 38, "k": "de/"}, {"t": "πληροῦται", "o": 41, "k": "plhrou=tai"}, {"t": "πιθανὸν", "o": 52, "k": "piqano/n"}]}, {"n": 2, "text": "δ' ἐστὶ τοὐναντίον συμβαίνειν. ἢ ὅτι τῶν μὲν ἀναπνεόντων", "joined": true, "tokens": [{"t": "δ'", "o": 0, "k": "d'"}, {"t": "ἐστὶ", "o": 3, "k": "e)sti/"}, {"t": "τοὐναντίον", "o": 8, "k": "tou)nanti/on"}, {"t": "συμβαίνειν", "o": 19, "k": "sumbai/nein"}, {"t": "ἢ", "o": 31, "k": "h)/"}, {"t": "ὅτι", "o": 33, "k": "o(/ti"}, {"t": "τῶν", "o": 37, "k": "tw=n"}, {"t": "μὲν", "o": 41, "k": "me/n"}, {"t": "ἀναπνεόντων", "o": 45, "k": "a)napneo/ntwn"}]}, {"n": 3, "text": "συμπιεζουμένη ταῖς πλευραῖς κάτω, καθάπερ αἱ φῦσαι,", "tokens": [{"t": "συμπιεζουμένη", "o": 0, "k": "sumpiezoume/nh"}, {"t": "ταῖς", "o": 14, "k": "tai=s"}, {"t": "πλευραῖς", "o": 19, "k": "pleurai=s"}, {"t": "κάτω", "o": 28, "k": "ka/tw"}, {"t": "καθάπερ", "o": 34, "k": "kaqa/per"}, {"t": "αἱ", "o": 42, "k": "ai("}, {"t": "φῦσαι", "o": 45, "k": "fu=sai"}]}, {"n": 4, "text": "προσογκεῖν φαίνεται;", "tokens": [{"t": "προσογκεῖν", "o": 0, "k": "prosogkei=n"}, {"t": "φαίνεται", "o": 11, "k": "fai/netai"}]}, {"n": 5, "text": "Διὰ τί ἀναπνέομεν; ἢ καθάπερ τὸ ὑγρὸν εἰς πνεῦμα", "tokens": [{"t": "Διὰ", "o": 0, "k": "dia/"}, {"t": "τί", "o": 4, "k": "ti/"}, {"t": "ἀναπνέομεν", "o": 7, "k": "a)napne/omen"}, {"t": "ἢ", "o": 19, "k": "h)/"}, {"t": "καθάπερ", "o": 21, "k": "kaqa/per"}, {"t": "τὸ", "o": 29, "k": "to/"}, {"t": "ὑγρὸν", "o": 32, "k": "u(gro/n"}, {"t": "εἰς", "o": 38, "k": "ei)s"}, {"t": "πνεῦμα", "o": 42, "k": "pneu=ma"}]}, {"n": 6, "text": "διαλύεται, οὕτω καὶ τὸ πνεῦμα εἰς τὸ πῦρ; τὸ τῆς φύσεως", "tokens": [{"t": "διαλύεται", "o": 0, "k": "dialu/etai"}, {"t": "οὕτω", "o": 11, "k": "ou(/tw"}, {"t": "καὶ", "o": 16, "k": "kai/"}, {"t": "τὸ", "o": 20, "k": "to/"}, {"t": "πνεῦμα", "o": 23, "k": "pneu=ma"}, {"t": "εἰς", "o": 30, "k": "ei)s"}, {"t": "τὸ", "o": 34, "k": "to/"}, {"t": "πῦρ", "o": 37, "k": "pu=r"}, {"t": "τὸ", "o": 42, "k": "to/"}, {"t": "τῆς", "o": 45, "k": "th=s"}, {"t": "φύσεως", "o": 49, "k": "fu/sews"}]}, {"n": 7, "text": "οὖν θερμὸν ὅταν τὸ πολὺ τοῦ πνεύματος πῦρ ποιήσῃ, ἀλγηδόνα", "joined": true, "tokens": [{"t": "οὖν", "o": 0, "k": "ou)=n"}, {"t": "θερμὸν", "o": 4, "k": "qermo/n"}, {"t": "ὅταν", "o": 11, "k": "o(/tan"}, {"t": "τὸ", "o": 16, "k": "to/"}, {"t": "πολὺ", "o": 19, "k": "polu/"}, {"t": "τοῦ", "o": 24, "k": "tou="}, {"t": "πνεύματος", "o": 28, "k": "pneu/matos"}, {"t": "πῦρ", "o": 38, "k": "pu=r"}, {"t": "ποιήσῃ", "o": 42, "k": "poih/sh|"}, {"t": "ἀλγηδόνα", "o": 50, "k": "a)lghdo/na"}]}, {"n": 8, "text": "ἐμποιεῖ, τοῖς δὲ πόροις καὶ ὄγκον· διόπερ ἐξωθοῦμεν", "tokens": [{"t": "ἐμποιεῖ", "o": 0, "k": "e)mpoiei="}, {"t": "τοῖς", "o": 9, "k": "toi=s"}, {"t": "δὲ", "o": 14, "k": "de/"}, {"t": "πόροις", "o": 17, "k": "po/rois"}, {"t": "καὶ", "o": 24, "k": "kai/"}, {"t": "ὄγκον", "o": 28, "k": "o)/gkon"}, {"t": "διόπερ", "o": 35, "k": "dio/per"}, {"t": "ἐξωθοῦμεν", "o": 42, "k": "e)cwqou=men"}]}, {"n": 9, "text": "τὸ πῦρ μετὰ τοῦ πνεύματος. ὅταν δὲ ἐξέλθῃ τὸ πνεῦμα καὶ", "tokens": [{"t": "τὸ", "o": 0, "k": "to/"}, {"t": "πῦρ", "o": 3, "k": "pu=r"}, {"t": "μετὰ", "o": 7, "k": "meta/"}, {"t": "τοῦ", "o": 12, "k": "tou="}, {"t": "πνεύματος", "o": 16, "k": "pneu/matos"}, {"t": "ὅταν", "o": 27, "k": "o(/tan"}, {"t": "δὲ", "o": 32, "k": "de/"}, {"t": "ἐξέλθῃ", "o": 35, "k": "e)ce/lqh|"}, {"t": "τὸ", "o": 42, "k": "to/"}, {"t": "πνεῦμα", "o": 45, "k": "pneu=ma"}, {"t": "καὶ", "o": 52, "k": "kai/"}]}, {"n": 10, "text": "τὸ πῦρ, συμπιπτόντων τῶν πόρων καὶ καταψυχομένων ἀλγηδόνες", "joined": true, "tokens": [{"t": "τὸ", "o": 0, "k": "to/"}, {"t": "πῦρ", "o": 3, "k": "pu=r"}, {"t": "συμπιπτόντων", "o": 8, "k": "sumpipto/ntwn"}, {"t": "τῶν", "o": 21, "k": "tw=n"}, {"t": "πόρων", "o": 25, "k": "po/rwn"}, {"t": "καὶ", "o": 31, "k": "kai/"}, {"t": "καταψυχομένων", "o": 35, "k": "katayuxome/nwn"}, {"t": "ἀλγηδόνες", "o": 49, "k": "a)lghdo/nes"}]}, {"n": 11, "text": "γίνονται· ἕλκομεν οὖν τὸ πνεῦμα πάλιν. εἶτα ἀνοίξαντες", "joined": true, "tokens": [{"t": "γίνονται", "o": 0, "k": "gi/nontai"}, {"t": "ἕλκομεν", "o": 10, "k": "e(/lkomen"}, {"t": "οὖν", "o": 18, "k": "ou)=n"}, {"t": "τὸ", "o": 22, "k": "to/"}, {"t": "πνεῦμα", "o": 25, "k": "pneu=ma"}, {"t": "πάλιν", "o": 32, "k": "pa/lin"}, {"t": "εἶτα", "o": 39, "k": "ei)=ta"}, {"t": "ἀνοίξαντες", "o": 44, "k": "a)noi/cantes"}]}, {"n": 12, "text": "τοῦ σώματος τοὺς πόρους καὶ βοηθήσαντες, πάλιν γίνεται", "joined": true, "tokens": [{"t": "τοῦ", "o": 0, "k": "tou="}, {"t": "σώματος", "o": 4, "k": "sw/matos"}, {"t": "τοὺς", "o": 12, "k": "tou/s"}, {"t": "πόρους", "o": 17, "k": "po/rous"}, {"t": "καὶ", "o": 24, "k": "kai/"}, {"t": "βοηθήσαντες", "o": 28, "k": "bohqh/santes"}, {"t": "πάλιν", "o": 41, "k": "pa/lin"}, {"t": "γίνεται", "o": 47, "k": "gi/netai"}]}, {"n": 13, "text": "τὸ πῦρ, καὶ πάλιν ἀλγοῦντες ἐκπέμπομεν, καὶ διὰ τέλους", "joined": true, "tokens": [{"t": "τὸ", "o": 0, "k": "to/"}, {"t": "πῦρ", "o": 3, "k": "pu=r"}, {"t": "καὶ", "o": 8, "k": "kai/"}, {"t": "πάλιν", "o": 12, "k": "pa/lin"}, {"t": "ἀλγοῦντες", "o": 18, "k": "a)lgou=ntes"}, {"t": "ἐκπέμπομεν", "o": 28, "k": "e)kpe/mpomen"}, {"t": "καὶ", "o": 40, "k": "kai/"}, {"t": "διὰ", "o": 44, "k": "dia/"}, {"t": "τέλους", "o": 48, "k": "te/lous"}]}, {"n": 14, "text": "τοῦτο πράττομεν, καθάπερ καὶ σκαρδαμύσσομεν κατὰ", "tokens": [{"t": "τοῦτο", "o": 0, "k": "tou=to"}, {"t": "πράττομεν", "o": 6, "k": "pra/ttomen"}, {"t": "καθάπερ", "o": 17, "k": "kaqa/per"}, {"t": "καὶ", "o": 25, "k": "kai/"}, {"t": "σκαρδαμύσσομεν", "o": 29, "k": "skardamu/ssomen"}, {"t": "κατὰ", "o": 44, "k": "kata/"}]}, {"n": 15, "text": "τὸ καταψύχεσθαι τὸ περὶ τὸν ὀφθαλμὸν σῶμα καὶ ξηραίνεσθαι.", "joined": true, "tokens": [{"t": "τὸ", "o": 0, "k": "to/"}, {"t": "καταψύχεσθαι", "o": 3, "k": "katayu/xesqai"}, {"t": "τὸ", "o": 16, "k": "to/"}, {"t": "περὶ", "o": 19, "k": "peri/"}, {"t": "τὸν", "o": 24, "k": "to/n"}, {"t": "ὀφθαλμὸν", "o": 28, "k": "o)fqalmo/n"}, {"t": "σῶμα", "o": 37, "k": "sw=ma"}, {"t": "καὶ", "o": 42, "k": "kai/"}, {"t": "ξηραίνεσθαι", "o": 46, "k": "chrai/nesqai"}]}, {"n": 16, "text": "καὶ βαδίζομεν οὖν προσέχοντες τῇ βαδίσει τὸν νοῦν,", "tokens": [{"t": "καὶ", "o": 0, "k": "kai/"}, {"t": "βαδίζομεν", "o": 4, "k": "badi/zomen"}, {"t": "οὖν", "o": 14, "k": "ou)=n"}, {"t": "προσέχοντες", "o": 18, "k": "prose/xontes"}, {"t": "τῇ", "o": 30, "k": "th=|"}, {"t": "βαδίσει", "o": 33, "k": "badi/sei"}, {"t": "τὸν", "o": 41, "k": "to/n"}, {"t": "νοῦν", "o": 45, "k": "nou=n"}]}, {"n": 17, "text": "κυβερνωμένης δὲ τῆς διανοίας αὐτοῖς .... τοῦτον οὖν τὸν", "tokens": [{"t": "κυβερνωμένης", "o": 0, "k": "kubernwme/nhs"}, {"t": "δὲ", "o": 13, "k": "de/"}, {"t": "τῆς", "o": 16, "k": "th=s"}, {"t": "διανοίας", "o": 20, "k": "dianoi/as"}, {"t": "αὐτοῖς", "o": 29, "k": "au)toi=s"}, {"t": "τοῦτον", "o": 41, "k": "tou=ton"}, {"t": "οὖν", "o": 48, "k": "ou)=n"}, {"t": "τὸν", "o": 52, "k": "to/n"}]}, {"n": 18, "text": "τρόπον καὶ τὰ περὶ τὴν ἀναπνοὴν ποιοῦμεν· μηχανώμενοι", "tokens": [{"t": "τρόπον", "o": 0, "k": "tro/pon"}, {"t": "καὶ", "o": 7, "k": "kai/"}, {"t": "τὰ", "o": 11, "k": "ta/"}, {"t": "περὶ", "o": 14, "k": "peri/"}, {"t": "τὴν", "o": 19, "k": "th/n"}, {"t": "ἀναπνοὴν", "o": 23, "k": "a)napnoh/n"}, {"t": "ποιοῦμεν", "o": 32, "k": "poiou=men"}, {"t": "μηχανώμενοι", "o": 42, "k": "mhxanw/menoi"}]}, {"n": 19, "text": "γὰρ τὸν ἀέρα ἕλκειν ἀναπνέομεν, καὶ πάλιν ἕλκομεν.", "tokens": [{"t": "γὰρ", "o": 0, "k": "ga/r"}, {"t": "τὸν", "o": 4, "k": "to/n"}, {"t": "ἀέρα", "o": 8, "k": "a)e/ra"}, {"t": "ἕλκειν", "o": 13, "k": "e(/lkein"}, {"t": "ἀναπνέομεν", "o": 20, "k": "a)napne/omen"}, {"t": "καὶ", "o": 32, "k": "kai/"}, {"t": "πάλιν", "o": 36, "k": "pa/lin"}, {"t": "ἕλκομεν", "o": 42, "k": "e(/lkomen"}]}], "english": {"text": "breath the stomach contracts, but when we expire it fills out? Now the contrary of this might be expected to occur. Is it because in breathing the stomach is compressed downwards by the flanks and then appears to expand again, like bellows? Why do we respire? Does the breath dissolve into fire, just as the moisture dissolves into breath? The heat, then, of nature, when the greater part of the breath produces fire, causes pain and pressure upon the ducts; and that is why we emit the fire with the breath. Now when the breath and fire go forth, the ducts contract and are cooled, and pain results; we therefore draw the breath in again. Then when we have opened the breath-ducts and given them relief, fire is again engendered and we again feel discomfort, and therefore expel it and continue to do so indefinitely; just as we continually blink as the part round the eye cools and becomes dry. Also we walk without giving attention to the manner of our walking, the intellect by itself guiding us. In like manner, therefore, we carry out the process of breathing; for we do so by contriving to draw in air, and then continue to draw it in.", "notes": [], "markers": [{"kind": "section", "n": "12", "offset": 241}], "bekker": [{"n": 1, "offset": 0, "real": true}, {"n": 5, "offset": 241, "real": true}, {"n": 10, "offset": 575, "real": true}, {"n": 15, "offset": 892, "real": false}]}}]}